    "np_faqs_LFwaVc": {
      "type": "np-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_FNT9KU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What exactly is a silver ion?",
            "answer": "<p>A silver ion is simply a charged particle of silver that we’ve bonded to our silk. You can’t see it or feel it, but it works at the microscopic level to naturally help fight bacteria. Silver has been trusted for centuries in wellness and medicine. This isn’t new science, just a smarter way to pair it with the beauty benefits of silk.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_WJRWJw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do silver ions work?",
            "answer": "<p>Silver ions naturally fight acne-causing bacteria from thriving on the surface of your pillowcase. Our Mineralized Silk™ has been clinically tested to eliminate over 99% of acne-causing bacteria.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_8wNnXY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long can I go between washes?",
            "answer": "<p> Because silver ions naturally resist bacteria, your Nodpod silk pillowcase can stay fresher up to 3–5 times longer than traditional silk pillowcases. Of course, things like makeup, hair products, and natural oils still build up, so we recommend washing when it feels right for you<em>.</em></p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_Qf8qJX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my mineralized silk pillowcase?",
            "answer": "<p>For the longevity and preservation of Mineralized Silk pillowcase, hand wash in cold water with a pH-neutral detergent. If you prefer machine washing, use the delicate cycle in a silk-only load. Turn the pillowcase inside out, avoid bleach or fabric softeners, and dry flat or hang in the shade out of direct sunlight.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_rw4gH9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will the silver ions last forever?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Mineralized Silk™ is treated with silver ions, they aren’t woven into the fabric itself. That treatment is designed to last for years of normal use. </p><p>Because the fabric stays fresher 3–5 times longer between washes, most people enjoy the benefits for well over a year or two. </p><p>Over time, with repeated washing, the treatment naturally begins to fade, but you’ll always have the timeless beauty benefits of premium silk, which inherently has skin and hair soothing properties.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_dpBWTM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does your pillowcase help with wrinkles or aging?",
            "answer": "<p>Silk naturally reduces friction on your skin, which helps minimize sleep creases that can turn into wrinkles over time. By pairing silk with silver ions, the Mineralized Silk™ Pillowcase also supports clearer, healthier-looking skin night after night.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_mxnEep": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does a silk pillowcase help my hair?",
            "answer": "<p>The smooth finish of silk reduces friction while you sleep, helping prevent breakage, frizz, and split ends. You’ll wake up with hair that looks and feels smoother compared to sleeping on cotton or other fabrics.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        }
      },
